00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.520
From Morocco to Byzantium

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:04.100
And before the 10th century ended

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:05.550
Life the lucky

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:08.050
Had stepped ashore in North America

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:17.000
Vikings were the first European colonists in America

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.190
Early in the 11th century

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:20.850
They built a settlement in a new land

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:21.910
They called Vinland

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:23.920
And remained three years

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:29.760
For centuries historians have speculated about Vinland

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:36.820
But in 1962, a Norwegian scholar unearthed Viking ruins on the northern tip of Newfoundland.

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:45.700
At their age of conquest, they were obsessed warriors.

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:50.630
They believed they earned their place in paradise by a glorious death in battle.

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:58.700
It was a celebration when a dead Viking chief was burned with his ship and sent to Valhalla.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:08.390
it was the coming of Christianity which destroyed their passion for battle and

00:09:08.390 --> 00:09:14.490
death. By the middle of the 11th century their power had waned. The age of the

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:26.070
