00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:36.320
now is the time when eels migrate from all over northern europe to their spawning grounds in the

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:44.950
sargasso sea near the island of bermuda on a day such as this with a strong wind off the baltic

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:53.980
the eels are driven into shore and into the maze of nets despite their heritage of the sea

00:11:53.980 --> 00:12:00.000
their skill and planning they still depend on a fisherman's luck a day's catch may be any

